WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[An atmospheric score emerges. A luminous violet form grows and opens into silver surfaces.]

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
[Surfaces fracture into connected architectural spans. Give the idea a direction.]

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
[The same surfaces become interfaces. A website wireframe resolves into finished type and layout.]

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
[Custom web applications. Selecting Engineering filters a project workspace to its two matching tasks.]

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
[Backend systems and integrations. An enquiry travels from website through API to business tools.]

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
[The interfaces separate and converge. The exact folded violet and silver Idiomorph emblem appears. The music resolves.]

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
IDIOMORPH STUDIO.
From ideas to what’s next.
[The closing signature fades into silence.]
